  { a = a + 5; printf("%d,%dn", a, &a); }
  else { a = a - 5; printf("%d, %dn", a, &a); }  </pre></code> Let u, v be the values printed by the parent process, and x, y be the values printed by the child process. Which one of the following is TRUE?

